    <section
      class="feature-grid"
      id="features"
      aria-label="Lurelia features"
    >
      <article class="feature-card wide reveal">
        <p class="card-kicker">Routines</p>

        <h3>Turn the things you want to do into a system you can actually follow</h3>

        <p>
          Build routines from individual tasks and give each routine the structure it
          needs to work in real life. Lurelia keeps your routines, their tasks,
          their details, and their progress together so you can focus on moving
          through them instead of remembering what comes next.
        </p>

        <div class="chip-row">
          <span>Routine Tasks</span>
          <span>Routine Details</span>
          <span>Progress</span>
          <span>Notifications</span>
          <span>Live Activities</span>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="feature-card reveal">
        <p class="card-kicker">Routine Tasks</p>

        <h3>Give every action the detail it deserves</h3>

        <p>
          Individual routine tasks have their own dedicated detail experience,
          allowing the actions inside your routines to carry the information and
          structure you need instead of becoming another collection of vague
          task names.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="feature-card reveal">
        <p class="card-kicker">Routine Contracts</p>

        <h3>Build the framework behind the routine</h3>

        <p>
          Routine contracts give you a dedicated place to define the personal
          structure surrounding a routine, helping turn repeated actions into a
          system with intention and accountability behind it.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="feature-card reveal">
        <p class="card-kicker">Habits</p>

        <h3>Build habits as part of your actual life</h3>

        <p>
          Create and track habits alongside everything else you are already planning.
          Dedicated habit details and history make it possible to understand what
          you are building without separating habits from the rest of your day.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="feature-card reveal">
        <p class="card-kicker">Reminders</p>

        <h3>Keep important things from quietly disappearing</h3>

        <p>
          Create reminders with dedicated details, notifications, completion tools,
          and history so the things you need to remember remain connected to the
          same system you use for routines, habits, events, and your schedule.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="feature-card wide reveal">
        <p class="card-kicker">Timeline & Kanban</p>

        <h3>See the shape of your day instead of another endless task list</h3>

        <p>
          Lurelia gives routine tasks a visual home through its Kanban and timeline
          experiences. Organize work into columns, understand where tasks belong,
          and see scheduled actions in relation to time so your plan feels like a
          day instead of a pile of disconnected items.
        </p>

        <div class="reader-preview">
          <div class="reader-preview-top">
            <span>Today's Progress</span>
            <strong>68%</strong>
          </div>

          <div class="reader-bar">
            <span></span>
          </div>

          <div class="reader-meta">
            <span>Routines</span>
            <span>Tasks</span>
            <span>Timeline</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
    </section>

    <section class="spotlight reveal">
      <div class="spotlight-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">Shared Events</p>

        <h2>Turn an event into a space people can actually share</h2>

        <p>
          Lurelia's shared events go beyond putting a date on a calendar. Create an
          event, share it with other people, manage RSVPs, publish posts and
          announcements, participate in comments, work with attachments, and
          keep everyone connected to the same event information.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="share-demo" aria-label="Lurelia share preview">
        <span class="share-pill">Shared Event</span>

        <h4>Bring people into the plan.</h4>

        <div class="share-row">
          <span>RSVP</span>
          <strong>Keep responses together</strong>
        </div>

        <div class="share-row">
          <span>Updates</span>
          <strong>Posts and announcements</strong>
        </div>

        <div class="share-row">
          <span>Conversation</span>
          <strong>Comments and attachments</strong>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="details-section reveal">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <p class="eyebrow">Everything Else</p>

        <h2>Open each part of the Lurelia experience</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="details-list">
        <details open>
          <summary>
            <span>
              <b>Routine Details</b>
              <small>See the structure behind what you are building</small>
            </span>
          </summary>

          <p>
            Open a routine to work with its tasks and the information attached to the
            routine itself. Dedicated routine and routine-task detail views keep
            the structure of your routines available without forcing everything
            into one oversized checklist.
          </p>
        </details>

        <details>
          <summary>
            <span>
              <b>Routine Notifications & Live Activities</b>
              <small>Keep active routines close when you need them</small>
            </span>
          </summary>

          <p>
            Routine notifications help bring scheduled actions back to your attention,
            while active routine support and Live Activities make it easier to
            stay connected to a routine that is already in progress.
          </p>
        </details>

        <details>
          <summary>
            <span>
              <b>Interactive Widgets</b>
              <small>Work with Lurelia without opening the full app</small>
            </span>
          </summary>

          <p>
            Lurelia includes widgets for routines, routine tasks, reminders, habits,
            upcoming events, and the Kanban timeline. Supported items can be
            completed directly through interactive widget actions, keeping
            everyday progress within easy reach.
          </p>
        </details>

        <details>
          <summary>
            <span>
              <b>Events & Apple Calendar</b>
              <small>Bring your schedule into the same system as your plans</small>
            </span>
          </summary>

          <p>
            Create and manage events through Lurelia's calendar and event experiences
            while working alongside Apple Calendar. Event details, occurrences,
            scheduling tools, notifications, and calendar integration keep
            scheduled life connected to the rest of Lurelia.
          </p>
        </details>

        <details>
          <summary>
            <span>
              <b>Shared Events</b>
              <small>Plan, communicate, and participate together</small>
            </span>
          </summary>

          <p>
            Shared events include sharing tools, RSVPs, host controls, posts and
            announcements, comments, attachments, and event information designed
            for experiences involving more than one person.
          </p>
        </details>

        <details>
          <summary>
            <span>
              <b>Kanban Board & Timeline</b>
              <small>Organize routine tasks visually</small>
            </span>
          </summary>

          <p>
            Create Kanban columns, assign routine tasks, and work with those tasks from
            visual board and timeline experiences. Supported actions let you work
            directly with the items in your schedule rather than constantly
            navigating back to their original routine.
          </p>
        </details>

        <details>
          <summary>
            <span>
              <b>Journeys</b>
              <small>Give longer paths somewhere to unfold</small>
            </span>
          </summary>

          <p>
            Journeys provide a dedicated space for progress that stretches beyond a
            single day. Build a larger direction from milestones and steps, keep
            notes attached to the journey, and follow its progress over time.
          </p>
        </details>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="community-banner reveal">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Built Around Real Days</p>

        <h2>Structure should support your life, not become another thing to manage.</h2>

        <p>
          Lurelia is built around the idea that routines, habits, reminders, events,
          schedules, and longer journeys affect one another. Each gets the space
          it needs while remaining part of one connected system that helps you
          move through your days with intention.
        </p>
      </div>

      <a class="primary-button raised-button" href="/github">
        Join the Community
      </a>
    </section>

    <section class="cta-section reveal">
      <p class="eyebrow">Explore Lurelia</p>

      <h2>Build a system that helps your days work with you.</h2>

      <p>
        Learn more about Lurelia, report a problem, share an idea, or reach out
        directly through Voxiverse Support.
      </p>

      <div class="cta-grid">
        <a
          href="https://github.com/asteriasmoons/Lurelia/issues"
          class="cta-card"
        >
          <span class="cta-kicker">Report an Issue</span>

          <h2>Lurelia Bug Reports</h2>

          <span class="cta-button">Open Reports</span>
        </a>

        <a href="/github" class="cta-card">
          <span class="cta-kicker">Ideas & Discussions</span>

          <h2>Voxiverse on GitHub</h2>

          <span class="cta-button">Open GitHub</span>
        </a>

        <a href="/contact" class="cta-card">
          <span class="cta-kicker">Need Help?</span>

          <h2>Contact Support</h2>

          <span class="cta-button">Get Support</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</DocsLayout>

<script>
  const revealItems = document.querySelectorAll(".reveal");

  const revealObserver = new IntersectionObserver(
    (entries) => {
      entries.forEach((entry) => {
        if (entry.isIntersecting) {
          entry.target.classList.add("is-visible");
          revealObserver.unobserve(entry.target);
        }
      });
    },
    { threshold: 0.12 }
  );

  revealItems.forEach((item) => revealObserver.observe(item));

  document
    .querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>("[data-lurelia-gallery]")
    .forEach((gallery) => {
      const track =
        gallery.querySelector<HTMLElement>("[data-gallery-track]");

      const slides = Array.from(
        gallery.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>(".gallery-slide")
      );

      const previousButton =
        gallery.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>(
          "[data-gallery-previous]"
        );

      const nextButton =
        gallery.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>(
          "[data-gallery-next]"
        );

      const count =
        gallery.querySelector<HTMLElement>("[data-gallery-count]");

      const progress =
        gallery.querySelector<HTMLElement>("[data-gallery-progress]");

      if (
        !track ||
        !slides.length ||
        !previousButton ||
        !nextButton
      ) {
        return;
      }

      let currentIndex = 0;
      let autoplay: number | undefined;
      let dragStartX = 0;

      const updateGallery = () => {
        track.style.transform =
          `translateX(-${currentIndex * 100}%)`;

        slides.forEach((slide, index) => {
          slide.classList.toggle(
            "is-active",
            index === currentIndex
          );
        });

        if (count) {
          count.textContent =
            `${currentIndex + 1} / ${slides.length}`;
        }

        if (progress) {
          progress.style.width =
            `${((currentIndex + 1) / slides.length) * 100}%`;
        }
      };

      const showSlide = (index: number) => {
        currentIndex =
          (index + slides.length) % slides.length;

        updateGallery();
      };

      const startAutoplay = () => {
        window.clearInterval(autoplay);

        autoplay = window.setInterval(
          () => showSlide(currentIndex + 1),
          4200
        );
      };

      const stopAutoplay = () => {
        window.clearInterval(autoplay);
      };

      nextButton.addEventListener("click", () => {
        showSlide(currentIndex + 1);
        startAutoplay();
      });

      previousButton.addEventListener("click", () => {
        showSlide(currentIndex - 1);
        startAutoplay();
      });

      gallery.addEventListener("pointerdown", (event) => {
        dragStartX = event.clientX;
        stopAutoplay();
      });

      gallery.addEventListener("pointerup", (event) => {
        const deltaX = event.clientX - dragStartX;

        if (Math.abs(deltaX) > 40) {
          showSlide(
            currentIndex + (deltaX < 0 ? 1 : -1)
          );
        }

        startAutoplay();
      });

      gallery.addEventListener(
        "mouseenter",
        stopAutoplay
      );

      gallery.addEventListener(
        "mouseleave",
        startAutoplay
      );

      gallery.addEventListener(
        "focusin",
        stopAutoplay
      );

      gallery.addEventListener(
        "focusout",
        startAutoplay
      );

      window.addEventListener(
        "resize",
        updateGallery
      );

      updateGallery();
      startAutoplay();
    });
</script>

<style>
  .lurelia-page {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    padding: 1rem 0 5rem;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .hero {
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns:
      minmax(0, 1.2fr)
      minmax(310px, 0.8fr);
    align-items: center;
    gap: 3rem;
    min-height: 620px;
    padding: 4rem 0;
  }

  .hero-copy,
  .hero-showcase {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
  }

  .hero h1 {
    max-width: 860px;
    margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
    font-size: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 6.5rem);
    line-height: 0.96;
    letter-spacing: -0.055em;
  }

  .eyebrow,
  .card-kicker,
  .mini-label {
    margin: 0 0 0.85rem;
    font-size: 0.76rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .hero-text,
  .intro-section p,
  .spotlight p,
  .community-banner p,
  .cta-section > p {
    max-width: 760px;
    font-size: 1.06rem;
  }

  .hero-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.85rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }

  .primary-button,
  .secondary-button {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    min-height: 50px;
    padding: 0.9rem 1.3rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 999px;
    color: var(--color-bg);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition:
      transform 0.2s ease,
      border-color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .primary-button {
    background: var(--accent-periwinkle);
  }

  .secondary-button {
    background: var(--surface-raised) !important;
    color: var(--color-text) !important;
  }

  .primary-button:hover,
  .secondary-button:hover {
    transform: translateY(-3px);
    border-color: var(--accent-periwinkle);
  }

  .hero-showcase {
    min-height: 410px;
  }

  .showcase-card,
  .floating-card,
  .feature-card,
  .share-demo,
  .details-list details,
  .community-banner,
  .cta-card {
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    background: var(--surface-standard);
    box-shadow: var(--glass-shadow-soft);
  }

  .main-card {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 55px 20px 55px 30px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 2rem;
    border-radius: 30px;
    transform: rotate(2deg);
  }

  .main-card h4 {
    max-width: 420px;
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.6rem);
    line-height: 1.05;
  }

  .progress-line {
    height: 10px;
    margin: 1.75rem 0;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--surface-raised);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .progress-line span {
    display: block;
    width: 72%;
    height: 100%;
    border-radius: inherit;
    background: var(--accent-periwinkle);
    animation: pulse-width 3s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  .showcase-stats {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 1rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .showcase-stats b {
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .floating-card {
    position: absolute;
    z-index: 3;
    padding: 1rem 1.15rem;
    border-radius: 18px;
    animation: float 5s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  .floating-card span {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .floating-card strong {
    font-size: 0.92rem;
  }

  .floating-card-one {
    top: 0;
    right: 0;
  }

  .floating-card-two {
    bottom: 8px;
    left: 0;
    animation-delay: -2.4s;
  }

  @media (min-width: 901px) {
    :global(.content:has(.lurelia-page)) {
      max-width: 1280px;
      padding-inline: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 3rem);
    }

    .hero {
      grid-template-columns:
        minmax(0, 1fr)
        minmax(340px, 380px);
      gap: clamp(2rem, 3.5vw, 4rem);
      min-height: 610px;
      padding: 2.15rem 0 2.65rem;
    }

    .hero h1 {
      max-width: 840px;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      font-size: 4.15rem;
      line-height: 1;
      letter-spacing: 0;
    }

    .hero-text {
      max-width: 660px;
      font-size: 1rem;
    }

    .hero-actions {
      margin-top: 1.5rem;
    }

    .hero-showcase {
      align-self: center;
      justify-self: end;
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 380px;
      min-height: 430px;
    }

    .main-card {
      inset: 58px 16px 104px 16px;
      padding: 1.45rem;
      border-radius: 26px;
      transform: none;
    }

    .main-card h4 {
      max-width: 320px;
      font-size: 2.35rem;
    }

    .progress-line {
      margin: 1.2rem 0;
    }

    .showcase-stats {
      gap: 0.65rem 0.9rem;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }

    .floating-card-one {
      top: 0;
      right: 0;
      max-width: 282px;
    }

    .floating-card-two {
      bottom: 16px;
      left: 0;
      max-width: 292px;
    }
  }

  @media (min-width: 901px) and (max-width: 1160px) {
    .hero {
      grid-template-columns:
        minmax(0, 1fr)
        minmax(320px, 340px);
      gap: 2rem;
    }

    .hero h1 {
      font-size: 3.7rem;
    }

    .main-card h4 {
      font-size: 2.1rem;
    }
  }

  @media (min-width: 1400px) {
    .hero h1 {
      font-size: 4.75rem;
    }
  }

  .intro-section {
    max-width: 850px;
    padding: 4rem 0 2rem;
  }

  .intro-section h2,
  .gallery-heading h2,
  .spotlight h2,
  .details-section h2,
  .community-banner h2,
  .cta-section h2 {
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.6rem);
    line-height: 1.05;
  }

  .lurelia-gallery-section {
    position: relative;
    padding: 2rem 0 3.25rem;
  }

  .gallery-heading {
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .lurelia-gallery {
    position: relative;
    width: min(100%, 430px);
    margin: 0 auto;
    overflow: hidden;
    padding: 1rem 0 2.75rem;
    touch-action: pan-y;
  }

  .gallery-track-container {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: 32px;
  }

  .gallery-track {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    will-change: transform;
    transition:
      transform 0.62s
      cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.8, 0.2, 1);
  }

  .gallery-slide {
    flex: 0 0 100%;
    margin: 0;
    opacity: 0.78;
    transition: opacity 0.35s ease;
  }

  .gallery-slide.is-active {
    opacity: 1;
  }

  .gallery-slide img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 1170 / 2532;
    object-fit: cover;
